			</th>
			<th style="border:solid #CED4DA 1.0pt;border-left:none;background:#005EB5;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;">
			<p style="margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.6pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center;"><strong>Resto base liquidable hasta (euros)</strong></p>
			</th>
			<th style="border:solid #CED4DA 1.0pt;border-left:none;background:#005EB5;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;">
